!! FIELD COLLISION III — Fold-map (proposed — operator decides what enters the memegraph)

* ''`live-equivocation.mem` #owed:'' CHURP as the constructive share-refresh (GRAFT-as-proactive-resharing on the FROST tier) that bounds the living-thief window; the residual (≥//t// shares in one epoch) stays inherent.
* ''`recovery-registration` / `recovery-ruling-layered`:'' the CHURP graft-refresh construction; ''the per-rotation/owner-burn witness threshold'' (did:webvh's every-update gating — the DECLARED-not-built gap in `handle-kel.ts` given a shape).
* ''`field-collision.mem`:'' did:webvh as the line-by-line twin + watcher-URLs-in-log (#the-coniks-resolution); Buchanan (malleable-id + shared-genesis + no-target-binding) as a deployed confused-deputy grave (#anti-patterns); the credible-exit tax ''costed and narrowed to the sealed plane'', PACELC named (#standing-tensions).
* ''`epoch-binding-surfaces.mem`:'' Sedimentree confirms "compaction picks nothing / not a fold" and the FS sacrifice at source; ''trailing-zeros-in-hash'' as the clockless boundary rule; did:webvh's `versionTime`-strictly-increasing as a fresh instance of the killed clock-dependency; the CHURP graft cadence = proactive-refresh interval.
* ''`carrier-head-shore` (memory):'' Buchanan as the crypto-layer proof of the quoting law — a signature that binds every field with `=` cannot replay onto a phantom target; the residual analogs (free-text attestation `claim`; the lax `OwnerHeadResolver` as our Buchanan-PDS, beside the `sharePolicy` stub in `next-vectors`).
* ''`dreamnet-architecture` / `nexus-topology`:'' a capacity-elected, reconstructible ''public-card discovery AppView'' blind to the sealed plane — permitted carriage, not a registry; RIBLT head-sighting as its verification-cheap transport.

''One-line takeaway:'' the field hands us one //constructive// answer to our hardest exposure (CHURP makes the graft refresh the shares, bounding the live-defector window on the FROST tier); one //concrete gap// in our own code (we threshold-gate the graft but let a single member rotate the signing key or burn the name — did:webvh gates every update); one //clean vindication with two live residuals// (our binding discipline structurally closes Buchanan's replay, but the attestation claim's meaning and a lax resolver remain confused-deputy surfaces); a //narrowing// of the ATProto contradiction (a reconstructible index of PUBLIC cards is carriage we already permit — the tax we truly pay is only on the sealed plane, and it is a seal-by-default choice, not anti-aggregator dogma); and a //concrete clockless mechanism// for compaction (Sedimentree's trailing-zeros boundary, with the compaction⊥revocation split confirmed verbatim). No sub-agents spawned; five primary sources fetched and collided directly.

